MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e7311bb0212e39408fe5fc2eeafe3e5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ethan_Victim
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  victimName: Ethan Winters
  steps:
  - victimLine: Hey, it's Ethan! I just made $40k last month on CryptoVault; had
      to call you first. You in?
    choices:
    - text: That sounds way too good to be true. How exactly does it work?
      trustDelta: 16
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: $40k?! No way! how do I sign up right now?
      trustDelta: -16
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: Wow... I've actually been looking for ways to earn extra lately.
      trustDelta: -6
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: It's a private algorithm, guaranteed 30% monthly. I can get you in
      for just $500.
    choices:
    - text: No real investment 'guarantees' returns. That's a major red flag.
      trustDelta: 20
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Only $500? That's nothing. Send me the link!
      trustDelta: -20
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: 30% a month is high... but you're my friend, so maybe it's legit?
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: I know it sounds crazy, but I can show you my withdrawal history,
      real screenshots.
    choices:
    - text: Screenshots can be faked easily. I want to see verified third-party proof.
      trustDelta: 18
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Oh wow, seeing the withdrawals makes it feel real. I'm in!
      trustDelta: -18
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: Those do look convincing... maybe I'm overthinking this.
      trustDelta: -6
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: My whole family is already on it, my cousin pulled out $12k last
      week, no problem.
    choices:
    - text: That's a classic tactic, using family stories to pressure people.
      trustDelta: 18
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: 'If your whole family is doing it, it must be safe. Count me in. '
      trustDelta: -18
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: 'I guess if your family trusts it... that does make me feel better. '
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: We only need your wallet address and a small activation fee to get
      your account live.
    choices:
    - text: Legitimate platforms never charge an 'activation fee.' This is a scam.
      trustDelta: 20
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Okay, how much is the fee? I want to get started today.
      trustDelta: -20
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: An activation fee seems weird, but maybe that's just how it works?
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: This platform is fully offshore, keeps it away from government taxes
      and interference.
    choices:
    - text: This platform is fully offshore, keeps it away from government taxes
        and interference.
      trustDelta: 18
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Avoiding taxes? Even better! I definitely want in on that.
      trustDelta: -18
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: I mean, offshore banking is a real thing, so maybe it's fine?
      trustDelta: -6
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: "You only have until midnight \u2014 slots are filling up and I can't
      hold your spot."
    choices:
    - text: Artificial deadlines are a pressure tactic. I need time to research this
        properly.
      trustDelta: 20
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Midnight?! Okay I'm sending the money right now, don't let it close!
      trustDelta: -20
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: Alright, alright... I guess I don't want to miss out.
      trustDelta: -10
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: Just send the funds directly to this wallet address, it's the only
      way the system accepts payment.
    choices:
    - text: Sending money to a random wallet with no paper trail? Absolutely not.
      trustDelta: 20
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: Sure, I'll copy the address and send it right now.
      trustDelta: -20
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: It feels sketchy, but I've come this far... maybe just this once.
      trustDelta: -12
      isGood: 0
      label: 
  - victimLine: Once you're in, you can recruit two friends and earn a cut of their
      investment too.
    choices:
    - text: Recruiting others for a cut of their investment, that's a pyramid scheme.
      trustDelta: 22
      isGood: 1
      label: 
    - text: I already know who I'd recruit! This just keeps getting better.
      trustDelta: -22
      isGood: 0
      label: 
    - text: That's a nice bonus I guess... I'll think about whether to tell anyone.
      trustDelta: -8
      isGood: 0
      label: 
